  "findings": {
    "D1": "Actor/CardActions reverse enqueue dependency within Combat",
    "D2": "Run public commands own outer publication and rollback during combat",
    "D3": "Room creation and settlement are valid Session–Combat boundaries",
    "D4": "Nodes is cross-state orchestration; nodes_common.complete is a mutator",
    "D5": "RelicHooks mixes permanent and battle lifetimes",
    "D6": "CardCapability queries runtime support, not only static data",
    "D7": "Events is combat read-model; ActionQueue is combat-specific",
    "D8": "Import rules do not prove injected capability/state semantics"
